</a></li></ul><p class="mkt-eyebrow mt-3 px-3 pb-1 text-fg-muted">Developers</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-1"><li><a class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm transition-colors text-white/75 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="/api-keys"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">API keys</span></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm transition-colors text-white/75 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="https://docs.lumenwipe.com"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">Docs</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="flex items-center justify-between rounded-lg px-3 py-2.5 text-sm transition-colors text-white/75 hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2">GitHub</span><span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3.5 w-3.5 opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul><a href="/es" hrefLang="es-419" lang="es-419" class="items-center text-fg-muted underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:underline mt-3 px-3 py-2.5">Español</a></div></div></header>"`;

exports[`English marketing copy footer renders the recorded markup 1`] = `"<footer class="relative border-t border-white/10 bg-canvas"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 lg:px-8"><div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_1fr_1fr]"><div><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2.5"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" class="h-7 w-auto" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1" y="1" width="30" height="30" rx="8" stroke="hsl(var(--accent))" stroke-opacity="0.35" stroke-width="1.25"></rect><path d="M7 22c4.5 3 13.5 3 18 0" stroke="hsl(var(--value))" stroke-opacity="0.9" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path><path d="M16 6.5c.7 4.2 2.3 5.8 6.5 6.5-4.2.7-5.8 2.3-6.5 6.5-.7-4.2-2.3-5.8-6.5-6.5 4.2-.7 5.8-2.3 6.5-6.5Z" fill="hsl(var(--accent))"></path></svg><span class="mkt-display text-body font-bold tracking-tight text-white">Lumen<span class="text-accent">Wipe</span></span></span><p class="mt-4 max-w-xs text-sm leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">Close any Stellar account cleanly and recover the XLM locked in its reserves. Non-custodial, signed in your browser, open source.</p><div class="mt-5 flex items-center gap-2"><a href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="GitHub" class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-white/10 text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-white/20 hover:text-white"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-4 w-4"><path d="M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4"></path><path d="M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2"></path></svg></a><a href="/es" hrefLang="es-419" lang="es-419" class="items-center text-fg-muted underline-offset-4 transition-colors hover:text-white hover:underline text-sm">Español</a></div></div><div><p class="mkt-eyebrow text-fg-muted">Product</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/mainnet">Open the app</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/testnet">Try on testnet</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/how-it-works">How it works</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security">Security</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://playground.lumenwipe.com">Playground<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/faq">FAQ</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/stats">Stats</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/registry">Exchange registry</a></li></ul></div><div><p class="mkt-eyebrow text-fg-muted">Guides</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/content">Guides and videos</a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/blog">Blog</a></li></ul></div><div><p class="mkt-eyebrow text-fg-muted">Developers</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/api-keys">API keys</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://docs.lumenwipe.com">Docs<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe">GitHub<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://docs.lumenwipe.com/architecture">Architecture<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div><div><p class="mkt-eyebrow text-fg-muted">Open source</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe/blob/main/SECURITY.md">Security policy<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="/security/reports">Security reports</a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md">Contributing<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li><li><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:text-white" href="https://github.com/LumenWipe/lumenwipe/blob/main/LICENSE">Apache 2.0 license<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-3 w-3 opacity-0 transition-opacity group-hover:opacity-50" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></a></li></ul></div></div><div class="mt-12 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/8 pt-6 text-xs text-fg-muted sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> LumenWipe · Open source under Apache 2.0.</p><p class="mkt-mono">Non-custodial · Signed in your browser</p></div></div></footer>"`;

exports[`English marketing copy not found renders the recorded markup 1`] = `"<div class="flex items-center justify-center px-5 py-16 lg:py-20"><div class="w-full max-w-md"><p class="mkt-eyebrow mb-7 text-fg-muted">ledger lookup · error_code: 404</p><div class="mb-9 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/[0.09] bg-surface/80 backdrop-blur-xs"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-white/[0.07] bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]/70"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]/70"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]/30"></span><span class="mkt-mono ml-3 text-xs text-fg-muted">lumenwipe · account-lookup</span></div><div class="space-y-4 px-5 py-5"><div class="mkt-mono text-sm"><span class="text-fg-muted">$ </span><span class="text-fg-muted">lw analyze --network mainnet </span><span class="text-white">this-page</span></div><ul class="mkt-mono space-y-2 text-sm"><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-success">✓</span><span class="text-fg-muted">Resolving route</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-success">✓</span><span class="text-fg-muted">Querying ledger state</span></li><li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span aria-hidden="true" class="text-danger-fg">✗</span><span class="text-danger-fg">Account found<!-- --> - account_not_found</span></li></ul><div class="border-t border-white/[0.07] pt-4"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center"><div><div class="mkt-mono text-base font-semibold text-fg-muted">0</div><div class="mkt-eyebrow mt-1 text-fg-muted">Subentries</div></div><div><div class="mkt-mono text-base font-semibold text-fg-muted">0.0000000</div><div class="mkt-eyebrow mt-1 text-fg-muted">XLM balance</div></div><div><div class="mkt-mono text-base font-semibold text-fg-muted">MERGED</div><div class="mkt-eyebrow mt-1 text-fg-muted">Status</div></div></div></div><div class="mkt-mono rounded-lg border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-2.5 text-xs text-fg-muted"><span class="text-fg-subtle">info </span>This account was merged out. Nothing remains on the ledger.</div></div></div><h1 class="mkt-display mb-3 text-display font-bold leading-[1] text-white">This page has<br/>been closed.</h1><p class="mb-8 text-body leading-relaxed text-white/85">No trustlines. No balance. No subentries.<br/>Looks like this route was already merged out.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-control font-semibold transition-colors duration-fast ease-standard disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 bg-accent text-accent-fg not-disabled:hover:bg-accent/90 not-disabled:active:bg-accent/80 min-h-12 px-5 text-sm" href="/"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-house lucide-home h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 21v-8a1 1 0 0 0-1-1h-4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v8"></path><path d="M3 10a2 2 0 0 1 .709-1.528l7-6a2 2 0 0 1 2.582 0l7 6A2 2 0 0 1 21 10v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"></path></svg>Back to home</a><a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-control font-semibold transition-colors duration-fast ease-standard disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40 border border-line-strong text-fg not-disabled:hover:bg-surface-raised not-disabled:active:bg-surface min-h-12 px-5 text-sm" href="/mainnet"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-merge h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="18" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"></circle><path d="M6 21V9a9 9 0 0 0 9 9"></path></svg>Open the app